* About
Tungsten is markup language, inspired by [Org mode|https://orgmode.org/] for Emacs.

* Syntax
** Heading
``
* H1
** H2
*** H3
``

** Text Styles
``
%bold%
/italic/
`code`
``

** Links
`{title|link}`

/italics *bold italics*/

italic
    string
        italics
    bold
        string
            bold italics